language design-core version 0.6.
contract BaselinePayload.
contract BaselineRequest.
field CalibrationState.
message MachineBaseline.
contract MachineProtocol.
channel MachineServiceUpstream.
message ReadBaseline.
field Subscriber.
BaselinePayload has completeness = closed.
BaselinePayload has-field CalibrationState.
BaselineRequest has completeness = closed.
BaselineRequest has-field Subscriber.
BuckingWeb uses MachineServiceUpstream as receiver of MachineBaseline in mode Inspection.
BuckingWeb uses MachineServiceUpstream as sender of ReadBaseline in mode Inspection.
CalibrationState has presence = required.
CalibrationState has value-type = text.
MachineBaseline has message-kind = result.
MachineBaseline replies-to ReadBaseline.
MachineBaseline upholds BaselinePayload.
MachineProtocol has completeness = closed.
MachineProtocol permits MachineBaseline.
MachineProtocol permits ReadBaseline.
MachineService uses MachineServiceUpstream as receiver of ReadBaseline in mode Inspection.
MachineService uses MachineServiceUpstream as sender of MachineBaseline in mode Inspection.
MachineServiceUpstream upholds MachineProtocol.
ReadBaseline has message-kind = request.
ReadBaseline upholds BaselineRequest.
Subscriber has presence = required.
Subscriber has value-type = text.
